    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "FANTASTIC THREE-BEDROOM SEMI-DETACHED PROPERTY, JUST A 5 MINUTE WALK FROM LONGFORD TOWN CENTRE & LOCATED JUST 350M FROM THE TRAIN STATION\r\n\r\nNew to the market, Davis Auctioneers present this fine three-bedroom semi-detached property, situated just off Park Road, a five-minute walk to the town centre. No. 5 Clabby Drive is situated adjacent to the Royal Canal, in a well-designed and maintained cul-de-sac of six houses only. This fine property would make the perfect owner occupier home, or indeed as an investment property.\r\nWithin minutes walking distance of the town centre, Longford Train station, Cathedral, Longford Slashers Gaa grounds, among the many facilities close by. Perfectly situated with easy access to both primary and secondary schools, while Backstage Theatre is just a ten-minute walk\r\n\r\nThe neat lay out of this red brick façade property, consists of a sitting room, kitchen-dining room, three bedrooms and a family bathroom. One of the many outstanding features of this fine property, is the attic roof space, that has been specifically designed to facilitate easy future conversion, for additional living accommodation.\r\n\r\nViewing of this property is highly recommended, but do not delay, we’ve just had huge success in neighbouring areas, so we expect this property to be an equally brilliant seller!\r\n\r\nPlease contact us on 043 3350555 to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nEircode N39 C2Y0"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Sitting Room: 4.10m x 4.30m\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining area: 3.05m x 6.10m\r\n\r\nWC\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 3.40m x 3.15m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 2.65m x 4.11m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 2.10m x 3.00m\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom: 2.00m x 2.25m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Cul-de-sac area of six well built and maintained properties\r\n\r\nAttic Stairs (folding)\r\n\r\nAttic roof space designed for easy conversion with roof windows\r\n\r\nBlock built Construction\r\n\r\nLess than a 5 minute walk to the Train & Bus Station\r\n\r\nLarge secure garden with shed\r\n\r\n10-minute walk to the Cathedral, Aldi, Lidl and Dunne Stores\r\n\r\nLongford Golf Club and Back Stage Theatre are within walking distance\r\n\r\nLess than a 10 minute walk to Longford Town Centre & shopping mall\r\n\r\nNational & Secondary Schools- 5 minute walk\r\n\r\nOil fired central heating\r\n\r\nSolid Fuel stove in sitting room\r\n\r\nFitted Wardrobes\r\n\r\nMains Water and sewerage\r\n\r\nAdjacent to The Royal Canal Greenway Walk\r\n\r\nDouble Glazed PVC Windows & Doors\r\n\r\nExcellent access to N4 Dublin/Sligo and N5 Longford/Westport Routes\r\n\r\nJust 1.5 miles from the N63/R397 Roscommon/Athlone Route\r\n\r\nFibre Broadband available"
      },
